# shotview.replay for the TX with the 5-way centre for the clicks: a drive, the fade to the map,
# the flight on the map, the result and the fade back. Start it on the tee view once it's drawn.
# Clicks after each swing start are 250 ms later than the meter times above: on the TX in Frond
# the meter's clock starts about then, once its first frames show. Frond's TX slows under load, so power varies.
0 key-down center
60 key-up center
1200 key-down center
1260 key-up center
1910 key-down center
1970 key-up center
